==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 46.67~66.67 seconds<sup>1,400f~2,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Let the Trolly Blogger attack your base to build up money for the bosses. The use of at least 4 meatshields is recommended without the presence of crowd-control.

